    {
      "id": "claim_23c60051bbbb4189ba15cca8791c7dbd",
      "statement": "When the agent targets a tab the shared `page-reader.ts` sends `show_brijio_tab_indicator` to that tab's content script before the request; the content script stores indicator state on `globalThis.__brijioIndicatorStates` and injects a `● ` title prefix (re-applied by a `MutationObserver`) plus a persistent blue in-page banner reading “Brijio is active on this tab”. This user-awareness mechanism is identical on Chrome and Safari (pure DOM, no extension API).",
